{"version":1,"content":"<p>牛頭角牛頭角道77號一商場內發生行刧案件。</p><p>昨晚（16日）11時許，警方接獲22歲黃姓女子報案指於上址遭人行刧。</p><p>警員到場調查發現，黃女於上址梯間被一名男子從後推跌並劫去約11,000元現金後向牛頭角道方向逃去。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T03:39:08.902413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:27:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:17:36.352164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:37:32.693294+00:00","content_hash":"80f9ef7ce2748e8ea60c279d8ed32df46fe2b034e7bf44116a666449448487c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}